  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周军，你知道吗？我身后这里是中国的迪拜，它曾经比深圳还要开放，但它将在五十年之后完全消失在沙漠里。这里不允许游客拍照，但它竟然是中国唯一没有差评的景点。这里的沙漠里居然还有红绿灯，而等红灯的不是汽车，竟然是骆驼。这里就是人生一定要来一次的地方。敦煌，你知道敦煌有多牛吗？它可是中国古代版的深圳、汉朝。改革开放的前沿阵地，相当于今天的上海，加上纽约，加上迪拜的综合体。敦煌是汉朝的西大门，向东是长安，洛阳继续向东延伸，可到朝鲜半岛、日本列岛向西，经过新疆的南北两道，翻过帕米尔高原，可达中亚。再往南，可以到印度，再往西可到波斯、两河流域、叙利亚、地中海世界，乃至古希腊和古埃及。从敦煌向北越过戈壁，又进入草原丝绸之路。敦煌是中原文明、印度文明、希腊文明、伊斯兰文明伟一的大规模教汇的土地。古代商人必须在敦煌申领过锁，也就是古代的通行证，才能够出关走玉门关阳关，才有了富的流油的丝绸之路。难怪这座城叫敦煌，蹲着大爷皇者盛宴，既博大又辉煌。敦煌，这两个字他配得上，但是你能想象吗？如此美好的敦煌，却是每一个中国人的伤心之地，没有人能笑着离开敦煌莫高窟。公元三六六年，僧人岳尊路经鸣沙山东路，忽然见到金光万耀如现万福。于是在岩壁上开凿了第一个洞窟。在之后的一千六百多年中，人们在高七十米长一千七百米的断崖之上，开辟了七百三十五个洞窟，画了四万五千多平米的壁画，还有两千四百多吨的彩塑。但在晚清时期，这些珍宝被西方列强大量骗取。一九零零年，英国人斯坦因带走了敦煌酒香经书图画刺绣。一九零七年，法国人伯希河带走敦煌藏经洞最精华的六千卷古书经文。一九二四年，美国人华尔纳到莫高窟玻璃的唐代精品壁画二十六块。如果你来到莫高窟，看到玻璃之后的壁画，一定会触目惊心，痛到泪目。如今，中国莫高窟的文物被收藏在全球各个地方的博物馆，在法国卢浮宫东京国立博物馆、俄国东方学研究所美国哈佛大学等等，唯独留在中国的寥寥少数。曾几何时，中国学者想要研究敦煌，还得屈辱，向外国购买胶卷和复印件。日本学者更是说了一句扎心的话。敦煌在中国敦煌穴在日本陈奕迅先生说，敦煌者，吴国学术之伤心实也。整整一百一十年前，一位叫常书红的年轻人在法国留学时，偶然发现一部敦煌画册，被他深深的震撼。我大老远来的欧洲学习艺术，才发现世界上最伟大的艺术，竟然就在中国在敦煌。他不顾所有人的反对，毅然回到了战火纷飞的祖国，要去保护，重现敦煌国宝种菜、种树、治沙、住破庙、吃咸菜、喝苦水，还要与各种企图掠夺敦煌宝藏的人周旋。张大千说，这里是无期徒刑，待了两年就走了。可是，常书红长沙那妇女竟然坚持了两万八千多个日夜，一起守护了数万届敦煌珍贵文物。不久前，长沙那奶奶来到敦煌，对着父亲常书红的墓，轻声呼唤着爸爸，哽咽的回忆起守护敦煌的点点滴滴。眼前这一幕是九十多岁的。长沙的奶奶在敦煌与八十多岁的樊景诗奶奶牵手告别，经几代人的接力守护，从修复第一幅壁画开始，到如今敦煌月牙泉的万人大合唱，再到千万人携手把国旗升在鸣沙山。所谓守护文明，就是明知道时间不可战胜，仍然有一些人愿意替后人多留住他一天。但是朱军你知道莫高窟为什么坚决不让拍照吗？敦煌一年一场，风从春刮到冬，而且最大风力可以达到十级。所以，在你我有生之年，整个敦煌莫高窟可能将永远消失在黄沙中。为了保护洞窟的壁画，敦煌研究院对每个洞窟进行实时监测，一旦有害物质超标，洞窟会立刻关闭。即便如此，敦煌壁画仍然不可避免的褪色剥落，而且游客呼出的二氧化碳和散发的热量，还有打开的闪光灯，对壁画的破坏都是不可逆的。敦煌莫高窟这一生看一眼扫一眼敦煌最残酷的地方，是你站在一千多年前的美面前，却知道他正在一点点老去。你知道敦煌人有多么不容易吗？三年之前，敦煌研究院考古编制的岗位有五六个人报名，但最后全部缺考。从一九四四年国立敦煌艺术研究所成立到今天七十多年里有上千名考古修复美术工作者扎根大漠。很多人一辈子隐姓埋名，每天趴在壁画上用几个月，甚至几年修复一面墙和氧化苏减等病害赛跑，择一世终一生。他们把一生埋进黄沙，只为了不让我们的文明也埋进黄沙。经过中国几代学者的默默努力，如今人们已经越来越重视保护敦煌。当我们和外国人谈论文化艺术的时候，终于可以腰杆挺直一点。在这里，你可以看到敦煌飞天，有的抱着乐器，有的撒花，有的翩翩起舞。看到世界上绝无仅有的反弹琵琶。看到西域传入的葡萄，看到唐代盛行的胡炫舞，看到西道当风的衣带究竟什么样？最美的是四十五窟的两尊菩萨像，他们都梳着高高的发髻，眉公弯弯，表情祥和，庄重慈悲，嘴角微微翘起。而你知道吗？敦煌壁画像竟然藏着中国人自己的十二星座，这就是敦煌莫高窟第六十一窟涌道的世圣光佛土，上面绘制有代表着黄道十二宫的圆形装饰，每一宫做一圆圈，分别是双鱼宫、白羊宫、金牛宫、天秤宫、巨蟹宫等等，和现代的十二星座图案几乎一模一样。原来咱老祖宗这么早就开始研究星座了，这千年的壁画让冰冷的石头洞窟一下子就了活的人间气儿。如今，敦煌藏经洞的文书简直是严重被低估的中古百科全书，这里有世界现存最古老的全天星图。敦煌星图绘制着一千三百多颗恒星，比西方最早的星徒早了三百多年，而这藏经洞封存的也是普通人的一生啊。除了佛家典籍，藏经洞，百分之九十的文书都是真实的社会档案有户籍地契，还有账本、酒单、故工合同等等。有记载了上千个中医药方，包括内科、外科、妇科、美容方、减肥方、香椿方，甚至还有求子方。最神奇的是，竟然还有唐代最温柔的离婚协议书。放妻书写着一别两宽，各生欢喜。这可不是修妻，而是夫妻双方和平解约。海底是老祖宗啊，没有谩骂指责，也没有撕破脸皮，男方甚至还会一次性付清三年的医疗费用，作为女方的生活补偿，这就是唐代好聚好散的样本，这就是敦煌最伟大的地方。他记录了不仅是帝王将相的家谱，更是普通人的喜怒哀乐。如今，如果你来到敦煌市的上空，可以清晰的看到在茫茫沙漠戈壁中的一大片绿洲，而敦煌就在这片绿洲中。在敦煌式的背后，祁连山二金山在此交汇，发源于祁连山腹地。青藏高原上的党河从两山之间穿流而过，绕过鸣沙山流入敦煌绿洲，滋养了这里上千年。你知道吗？原来敦煌还能撑多久，答案就藏在祁连山的雪里。一旦祁连山降雪减少，或者河流改道断流，敦煌就会迅速被沙漠吞没。历史上曾经繁华一时的楼兰古城，正是因为水源消失，一夜之间被风沙掩埋。而敦煌和楼兰的地理结构几乎一模一样，同样依赖内陆河，同样守在沙漠边缘。同样没有稳定的外部水源补给，唯一的区别是敦煌还没有断水。但在今天，随着气候变化和人类用水增加，敦煌的水资源正在变得越来越紧张。如果有一天，河流真的撑不住了，那么，敦煌的命运会不会重演？楼兰的结局你知道吗？敦煌是我见过的最珍视游客的城市，没有之一市容市吗？竟然比很多一线城市还要好。这里没有国内旅游城市的弊病，比如脏乱差的街道、高频次的摆摊、叫卖、旅拍、拉人、出租车、套路、横冲直撞的汽车、电动车等等。敦煌打车起步价，只要六块钱，从鸣沙山到夜市，还有一辆接着一辆的免费接驳车。这里的夜市可没有千篇一律的景区大鱿鱼臭豆腐，全是地地道道的西北风味，价格公道，出品干净稳定。甚至你能想象吗？夜晚十二点的敦煌店，还有理发店开门，因为晚上很多从沙漠上下来的旅客，一头沙子，或者有妆发都比较难洗。一天下来也比较累了，自己洗又很麻烦，所以他们开到晚上一点半左右，真的是处处为游客着想，吃住行都能给你安排的妥妥当当。而且你知道吗？月牙泉景区内竟然还有红绿灯，第一次见到沙漠里的红绿灯，你是不是会觉得很奇怪？其实这红绿灯专门是给骆驼队修建的分流人和骆驼。绿灯亮的时候呢，骆驼就会自己行走，红灯亮，骆驼就会停到了旅游旺季的时候，这里面还会出现堵骆驼的情况。你能想象吗？眼前这些柳树叫左公柳，当年左宗棠下令从陕西到新疆的沿途广种柳树杨树，至今在敦煌鸣沙山月牙泉畔，仍存有他所植树林，超过一百四十年的月泉古柳。而你知道吗？在敦煌找不到任何一根还在冒烟的火电厂烟囱，中国人在敦煌造了一个太阳。你在深夜熟睡时，中国西北的荒漠正在挂着一颗人造太阳。它不是科幻电影的道具，而是一座真实月进行了超级电站。敦煌已经成了全中国唯一一个百分之百绿电覆盖的城市。而敦煌自己发的这些电跨越几千公里，冲向湖南，点亮上海的摩天大楼，成为你手机屏幕上跳动的那个绿色电能，这就是文明的浪漫。如今我们今天花几个小时就能抵达的敦煌，是古人用半生才能抵达的远方。这里有王道士的无声叹息，有常春红樊景师们的终身守护，有春风不度玉门关的苍凉，也有西出阳关无故人的怅然。霍去病的马蹄声逐渐远去，左宫柳还在月牙泉边摇曳，我们终会老去，但文明不能在我手里老去。祖先们把一千年前的敦煌交给了我们我们，又将把一个怎样敦煌交给下一个一千年。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 480,
      "end_ms": 880,
      "text": "周军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1140,
      "end_ms": 1840,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1980,
      "end_ms": 3920,
      "text": "我身后这里是中国的迪拜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4020,
      "end_ms": 5960,
      "text": "它曾经比深圳还要开放，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6200,
      "end_ms": 9360,
      "text": "但它将在五十年之后完全消失在沙漠里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9580,
      "end_ms": 11340,
      "text": "这里不允许游客拍照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11560,
      "end_ms": 14100,
      "text": "但它竟然是中国唯一没有差评的景点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14400,
      "end_ms": 16480,
      "text": "这里的沙漠里居然还有红绿灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16580,
      "end_ms": 18160,
      "text": "而等红灯的不是汽车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18320,
      "end_ms": 19540,
      "text": "竟然是骆驼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20000,
      "end_ms": 22280,
      "text": "这里就是人生一定要来一次的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22660,
      "end_ms": 23180,
      "text": "敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23840,
      "end_ms": 25640,
      "text": "你知道敦煌有多牛吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 25680,
      "end_ms": 28280,
      "text": "它可是中国古代版的深圳、汉朝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28320,
      "end_ms": 30015,
      "text": "改革开放的前沿阵地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30310,
      "end_ms": 31670,
      "text": "相当于今天的上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31690,
      "end_ms": 32490,
      "text": "加上纽约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32530,
      "end_ms": 33990,
      "text": "加上迪拜的综合体。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34310,
      "end_ms": 36090,
      "text": "敦煌是汉朝的西大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36290,
      "end_ms": 37390,
      "text": "向东是长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 37390,
      "end_ms": 39050,
      "text": "洛阳继续向东延伸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39050,
      "end_ms": 41430,
      "text": "可到朝鲜半岛、日本列岛向西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41470,
      "end_ms": 42970,
      "text": "经过新疆的南北两道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 42990,
      "end_ms": 44110,
      "text": "翻过帕米尔高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 44130,
      "end_ms": 44890,
      "text": "可达中亚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 45170,
      "end_ms": 45730,
      "text": "再往南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 45770,
      "end_ms": 46690,
      "text": "可以到印度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 46750,
      "end_ms": 50110,
      "text": "再往西可到波斯、两河流域、叙利亚、地中海世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50210,
      "end_ms": 51730,
      "text": "乃至古希腊和古埃及。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 51990,
      "end_ms": 53810,
      "text": "从敦煌向北越过戈壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53830,
      "end_ms": 55610,
      "text": "又进入草原丝绸之路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 55890,
      "end_ms": 61985,
      "text": "敦煌是中原文明、印度文明、希腊文明、伊斯兰文明伟一的大规模教汇的土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62440,
      "end_ms": 64860,
      "text": "古代商人必须在敦煌申领过锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64900,
      "end_ms": 66200,
      "text": "也就是古代的通行证，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 66340,
      "end_ms": 68990,
      "text": "才能够出关走玉门关阳关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 69290,
      "end_ms": 71470,
      "text": "才有了富的流油的丝绸之路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 71750,
      "end_ms": 73695,
      "text": "难怪这座城叫敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74160,
      "end_ms": 76975,
      "text": "蹲着大爷皇者盛宴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 77300,
      "end_ms": 78885,
      "text": "既博大又辉煌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 79160,
      "end_ms": 79540,
      "text": "敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 79540,
      "end_ms": 81185,
      "text": "这两个字他配得上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 81660,
      "end_ms": 82660,
      "text": "但是你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 82660,
      "end_ms": 83880,
      "text": "如此美好的敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 84060,
      "end_ms": 86175,
      "text": "却是每一个中国人的伤心之地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 86470,
      "end_ms": 89335,
      "text": "没有人能笑着离开敦煌莫高窟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 89920,
      "end_ms": 91100,
      "text": "公元三六六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 91280,
      "end_ms": 94085,
      "text": "僧人岳尊路经鸣沙山东路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 94380,
      "end_ms": 96995,
      "text": "忽然见到金光万耀如现万福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 97300,
      "end_ms": 99615,
      "text": "于是在岩壁上开凿了第一个洞窟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 99920,
      "end_ms": 101625,
      "text": "在之后的一千六百多年中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 101870,
      "end_ms": 105085,
      "text": "人们在高七十米长一千七百米的断崖之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 105320,
      "end_ms": 107255,
      "text": "开辟了七百三十五个洞窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 107510,
      "end_ms": 109550,
      "text": "画了四万五千多平米的壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 109730,
      "end_ms": 111665,
      "text": "还有两千四百多吨的彩塑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 112010,
      "end_ms": 113050,
      "text": "但在晚清时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 113070,
      "end_ms": 115765,
      "text": "这些珍宝被西方列强大量骗取。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 116200,
      "end_ms": 117100,
      "text": "一九零零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 117240,
      "end_ms": 121025,
      "text": "英国人斯坦因带走了敦煌酒香经书图画刺绣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 121360,
      "end_ms": 122180,
      "text": "一九零七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 122300,
      "end_ms": 127065,
      "text": "法国人伯希河带走敦煌藏经洞最精华的六千卷古书经文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 127400,
      "end_ms": 128260,
      "text": "一九二四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 128400,
      "end_ms": 132865,
      "text": "美国人华尔纳到莫高窟玻璃的唐代精品壁画二十六块。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 133280,
      "end_ms": 134440,
      "text": "如果你来到莫高窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 134440,
      "end_ms": 136020,
      "text": "看到玻璃之后的壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 136040,
      "end_ms": 137380,
      "text": "一定会触目惊心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 137580,
      "end_ms": 138425,
      "text": "痛到泪目。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 138810,
      "end_ms": 139250,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 139530,
      "end_ms": 143205,
      "text": "中国莫高窟的文物被收藏在全球各个地方的博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 143520,
      "end_ms": 149350,
      "text": "在法国卢浮宫东京国立博物馆、俄国东方学研究所美国哈佛大学等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 149530,
      "end_ms": 152295,
      "text": "唯独留在中国的寥寥少数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 153440,
      "text": "曾几何时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 153640,
      "end_ms": 155580,
      "text": "中国学者想要研究敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 155740,
      "end_ms": 156520,
      "text": "还得屈辱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 156540,
      "end_ms": 158445,
      "text": "向外国购买胶卷和复印件。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 158750,
      "end_ms": 160765,
      "text": "日本学者更是说了一句扎心的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 161120,
      "end_ms": 165205,
      "text": "敦煌在中国敦煌穴在日本陈奕迅先生说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 165420,
      "end_ms": 166120,
      "text": "敦煌者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 166200,
      "end_ms": 168245,
      "text": "吴国学术之伤心实也。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 168540,
      "end_ms": 169860,
      "text": "整整一百一十年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 169940,
      "end_ms": 173040,
      "text": "一位叫常书红的年轻人在法国留学时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 173200,
      "end_ms": 174760,
      "text": "偶然发现一部敦煌画册，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 174760,
      "end_ms": 176005,
      "text": "被他深深的震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 176330,
      "end_ms": 178250,
      "text": "我大老远来的欧洲学习艺术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 178410,
      "end_ms": 180210,
      "text": "才发现世界上最伟大的艺术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 180210,
      "end_ms": 182195,
      "text": "竟然就在中国在敦煌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 182540,
      "end_ms": 183780,
      "text": "他不顾所有人的反对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 183780,
      "end_ms": 185780,
      "text": "毅然回到了战火纷飞的祖国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 185920,
      "end_ms": 186660,
      "text": "要去保护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 186840,
      "end_ms": 193685,
      "text": "重现敦煌国宝种菜、种树、治沙、住破庙、吃咸菜、喝苦水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 194020,
      "end_ms": 196815,
      "text": "还要与各种企图掠夺敦煌宝藏的人周旋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 197240,
      "end_ms": 198000,
      "text": "张大千说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00092",
      "start_ms": 198140,
      "end_ms": 199460,
      "text": "这里是无期徒刑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00093",
      "start_ms": 199640,
      "end_ms": 200875,
      "text": "待了两年就走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00094",
      "start_ms": 201180,
      "end_ms": 201480,
      "text": "可是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00095",
      "start_ms": 201480,
      "end_ms": 205775,
      "text": "常书红长沙那妇女竟然坚持了两万八千多个日夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00096",
      "start_ms": 206010,
      "end_ms": 208785,
      "text": "一起守护了数万届敦煌珍贵文物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00097",
      "start_ms": 209200,
      "end_ms": 209720,
      "text": "不久前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00098",
      "start_ms": 209780,
      "end_ms": 211380,
      "text": "长沙那奶奶来到敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00099",
      "start_ms": 211640,
      "end_ms": 213160,
      "text": "对着父亲常书红的墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00100",
      "start_ms": 213340,
      "end_ms": 214725,
      "text": "轻声呼唤着爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00101",
      "start_ms": 214980,
      "end_ms": 217635,
      "text": "哽咽的回忆起守护敦煌的点点滴滴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00102",
      "start_ms": 217990,
      "end_ms": 219750,
      "text": "眼前这一幕是九十多岁的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00103",
      "start_ms": 219750,
      "end_ms": 224395,
      "text": "长沙的奶奶在敦煌与八十多岁的樊景诗奶奶牵手告别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00104",
      "start_ms": 224940,
      "end_ms": 226780,
      "text": "经几代人的接力守护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00105",
      "start_ms": 227040,
      "end_ms": 228960,
      "text": "从修复第一幅壁画开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00106",
      "start_ms": 229080,
      "end_ms": 231665,
      "text": "到如今敦煌月牙泉的万人大合唱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00107",
      "start_ms": 231990,
      "end_ms": 235415,
      "text": "再到千万人携手把国旗升在鸣沙山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00108",
      "start_ms": 236080,
      "end_ms": 237165,
      "text": "所谓守护文明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00109",
      "start_ms": 237390,
      "end_ms": 239375,
      "text": "就是明知道时间不可战胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00110",
      "start_ms": 239660,
      "end_ms": 242875,
      "text": "仍然有一些人愿意替后人多留住他一天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00111",
      "start_ms": 243330,
      "end_ms": 246705,
      "text": "但是朱军你知道莫高窟为什么坚决不让拍照吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00112",
      "start_ms": 247190,
      "end_ms": 248570,
      "text": "敦煌一年一场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00113",
      "start_ms": 248570,
      "end_ms": 250170,
      "text": "风从春刮到冬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00114",
      "start_ms": 250370,
      "end_ms": 252435,
      "text": "而且最大风力可以达到十级。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00115",
      "start_ms": 252900,
      "end_ms": 253140,
      "text": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00116",
      "start_ms": 253140,
      "end_ms": 254340,
      "text": "在你我有生之年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00117",
      "start_ms": 254480,
      "end_ms": 258495,
      "text": "整个敦煌莫高窟可能将永远消失在黄沙中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00118",
      "start_ms": 258900,
      "end_ms": 260260,
      "text": "为了保护洞窟的壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00119",
      "start_ms": 260360,
      "end_ms": 263035,
      "text": "敦煌研究院对每个洞窟进行实时监测，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00120",
      "start_ms": 263300,
      "end_ms": 264520,
      "text": "一旦有害物质超标，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00121",
      "start_ms": 264640,
      "end_ms": 265975,
      "text": "洞窟会立刻关闭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00122",
      "start_ms": 266320,
      "end_ms": 267060,
      "text": "即便如此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00123",
      "start_ms": 267140,
      "end_ms": 270145,
      "text": "敦煌壁画仍然不可避免的褪色剥落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00124",
      "start_ms": 270550,
      "end_ms": 273315,
      "text": "而且游客呼出的二氧化碳和散发的热量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00125",
      "start_ms": 273570,
      "end_ms": 274835,
      "text": "还有打开的闪光灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00126",
      "start_ms": 275050,
      "end_ms": 277215,
      "text": "对壁画的破坏都是不可逆的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00127",
      "start_ms": 277560,
      "end_ms": 282710,
      "text": "敦煌莫高窟这一生看一眼扫一眼敦煌最残酷的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00128",
      "start_ms": 282790,
      "end_ms": 285250,
      "text": "是你站在一千多年前的美面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00129",
      "start_ms": 285390,
      "end_ms": 287855,
      "text": "却知道他正在一点点老去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00130",
      "start_ms": 288340,
      "end_ms": 290360,
      "text": "你知道敦煌人有多么不容易吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00131",
      "start_ms": 290520,
      "end_ms": 291260,
      "text": "三年之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00132",
      "start_ms": 291260,
      "end_ms": 294950,
      "text": "敦煌研究院考古编制的岗位有五六个人报名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00133",
      "start_ms": 294970,
      "end_ms": 296545,
      "text": "但最后全部缺考。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00134",
      "start_ms": 296970,
      "end_ms": 305830,
      "text": "从一九四四年国立敦煌艺术研究所成立到今天七十多年里有上千名考古修复美术工作者扎根大漠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00135",
      "start_ms": 306010,
      "end_ms": 307750,
      "text": "很多人一辈子隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00136",
      "start_ms": 307930,
      "end_ms": 310030,
      "text": "每天趴在壁画上用几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00137",
      "start_ms": 310130,
      "end_ms": 314930,
      "text": "甚至几年修复一面墙和氧化苏减等病害赛跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00138",
      "start_ms": 315310,
      "end_ms": 316790,
      "text": "择一世终一生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00139",
      "start_ms": 317010,
      "end_ms": 318770,
      "text": "他们把一生埋进黄沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00140",
      "start_ms": 318970,
      "end_ms": 321630,
      "text": "只为了不让我们的文明也埋进黄沙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00141",
      "start_ms": 321910,
      "end_ms": 324030,
      "text": "经过中国几代学者的默默努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00142",
      "start_ms": 324150,
      "end_ms": 326605,
      "text": "如今人们已经越来越重视保护敦煌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00143",
      "start_ms": 327020,
      "end_ms": 329420,
      "text": "当我们和外国人谈论文化艺术的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00144",
      "start_ms": 329480,
      "end_ms": 331520,
      "text": "终于可以腰杆挺直一点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00145",
      "start_ms": 331880,
      "end_ms": 332420,
      "text": "在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00146",
      "start_ms": 332420,
      "end_ms": 333920,
      "text": "你可以看到敦煌飞天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00147",
      "start_ms": 334080,
      "end_ms": 335160,
      "text": "有的抱着乐器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00148",
      "start_ms": 335260,
      "end_ms": 336000,
      "text": "有的撒花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00149",
      "start_ms": 336080,
      "end_ms": 337320,
      "text": "有的翩翩起舞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00150",
      "start_ms": 337460,
      "end_ms": 340020,
      "text": "看到世界上绝无仅有的反弹琵琶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00151",
      "start_ms": 340200,
      "end_ms": 341740,
      "text": "看到西域传入的葡萄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00152",
      "start_ms": 341860,
      "end_ms": 343840,
      "text": "看到唐代盛行的胡炫舞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00153",
      "start_ms": 344060,
      "end_ms": 346840,
      "text": "看到西道当风的衣带究竟什么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00154",
      "start_ms": 347260,
      "end_ms": 349580,
      "text": "最美的是四十五窟的两尊菩萨像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00155",
      "start_ms": 349740,
      "end_ms": 351380,
      "text": "他们都梳着高高的发髻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00156",
      "start_ms": 351720,
      "end_ms": 352700,
      "text": "眉公弯弯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00157",
      "start_ms": 352760,
      "end_ms": 353720,
      "text": "表情祥和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00158",
      "start_ms": 353760,
      "end_ms": 354740,
      "text": "庄重慈悲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00159",
      "start_ms": 354900,
      "end_ms": 356385,
      "text": "嘴角微微翘起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00160",
      "start_ms": 356780,
      "end_ms": 357540,
      "text": "而你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00161",
      "start_ms": 357640,
      "end_ms": 361075,
      "text": "敦煌壁画像竟然藏着中国人自己的十二星座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00162",
      "start_ms": 361380,
      "end_ms": 365455,
      "text": "这就是敦煌莫高窟第六十一窟涌道的世圣光佛土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00163",
      "start_ms": 365810,
      "end_ms": 369110,
      "text": "上面绘制有代表着黄道十二宫的圆形装饰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00164",
      "start_ms": 369250,
      "end_ms": 370730,
      "text": "每一宫做一圆圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00165",
      "start_ms": 370910,
      "end_ms": 375630,
      "text": "分别是双鱼宫、白羊宫、金牛宫、天秤宫、巨蟹宫等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00166",
      "start_ms": 375730,
      "end_ms": 378395,
      "text": "和现代的十二星座图案几乎一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00167",
      "start_ms": 378730,
      "end_ms": 381355,
      "text": "原来咱老祖宗这么早就开始研究星座了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00168",
      "start_ms": 381670,
      "end_ms": 386335,
      "text": "这千年的壁画让冰冷的石头洞窟一下子就了活的人间气儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00169",
      "start_ms": 386670,
      "end_ms": 387115,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00170",
      "start_ms": 387410,
      "end_ms": 392245,
      "text": "敦煌藏经洞的文书简直是严重被低估的中古百科全书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00171",
      "start_ms": 392620,
      "end_ms": 395260,
      "text": "这里有世界现存最古老的全天星图。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00172",
      "start_ms": 395440,
      "end_ms": 398455,
      "text": "敦煌星图绘制着一千三百多颗恒星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00173",
      "start_ms": 398690,
      "end_ms": 400975,
      "text": "比西方最早的星徒早了三百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00174",
      "start_ms": 401230,
      "end_ms": 404145,
      "text": "而这藏经洞封存的也是普通人的一生啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00175",
      "start_ms": 404380,
      "end_ms": 405365,
      "text": "除了佛家典籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00176",
      "start_ms": 405620,
      "end_ms": 406100,
      "text": "藏经洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00177",
      "start_ms": 406100,
      "end_ms": 410170,
      "text": "百分之九十的文书都是真实的社会档案有户籍地契，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00178",
      "start_ms": 410390,
      "end_ms": 413135,
      "text": "还有账本、酒单、故工合同等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00179",
      "start_ms": 413430,
      "end_ms": 415490,
      "text": "有记载了上千个中医药方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00180",
      "start_ms": 415650,
      "end_ms": 419710,
      "text": "包括内科、外科、妇科、美容方、减肥方、香椿方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00181",
      "start_ms": 419810,
      "end_ms": 421145,
      "text": "甚至还有求子方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00182",
      "start_ms": 421530,
      "end_ms": 422350,
      "text": "最神奇的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00183",
      "start_ms": 422410,
      "end_ms": 425135,
      "text": "竟然还有唐代最温柔的离婚协议书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00184",
      "start_ms": 425420,
      "end_ms": 428040,
      "text": "放妻书写着一别两宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00185",
      "start_ms": 428220,
      "end_ms": 429215,
      "text": "各生欢喜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00186",
      "start_ms": 429550,
      "end_ms": 430570,
      "text": "这可不是修妻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00187",
      "start_ms": 430710,
      "end_ms": 432925,
      "text": "而是夫妻双方和平解约。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00188",
      "start_ms": 433240,
      "end_ms": 434400,
      "text": "海底是老祖宗啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00189",
      "start_ms": 434440,
      "end_ms": 435540,
      "text": "没有谩骂指责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00190",
      "start_ms": 435540,
      "end_ms": 436965,
      "text": "也没有撕破脸皮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00191",
      "start_ms": 437320,
      "end_ms": 440920,
      "text": "男方甚至还会一次性付清三年的医疗费用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00192",
      "start_ms": 441000,
      "end_ms": 442400,
      "text": "作为女方的生活补偿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00193",
      "start_ms": 442580,
      "end_ms": 445085,
      "text": "这就是唐代好聚好散的样本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00194",
      "start_ms": 445410,
      "end_ms": 447110,
      "text": "这就是敦煌最伟大的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00195",
      "start_ms": 447250,
      "end_ms": 449490,
      "text": "他记录了不仅是帝王将相的家谱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00196",
      "start_ms": 449650,
      "end_ms": 451925,
      "text": "更是普通人的喜怒哀乐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00197",
      "start_ms": 452590,
      "end_ms": 453035,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00198",
      "start_ms": 453340,
      "end_ms": 454900,
      "text": "如果你来到敦煌市的上空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00199",
      "start_ms": 455040,
      "end_ms": 458810,
      "text": "可以清晰的看到在茫茫沙漠戈壁中的一大片绿洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00200",
      "start_ms": 458910,
      "end_ms": 461095,
      "text": "而敦煌就在这片绿洲中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00201",
      "start_ms": 461410,
      "end_ms": 462515,
      "text": "在敦煌式的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00202",
      "start_ms": 462830,
      "end_ms": 464610,
      "text": "祁连山二金山在此交汇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00203",
      "start_ms": 464790,
      "end_ms": 466110,
      "text": "发源于祁连山腹地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00204",
      "start_ms": 466110,
      "end_ms": 469850,
      "text": "青藏高原上的党河从两山之间穿流而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00205",
      "start_ms": 470030,
      "end_ms": 472470,
      "text": "绕过鸣沙山流入敦煌绿洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00206",
      "start_ms": 472630,
      "end_ms": 474145,
      "text": "滋养了这里上千年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00207",
      "start_ms": 474730,
      "end_ms": 475365,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00208",
      "start_ms": 475630,
      "end_ms": 477255,
      "text": "原来敦煌还能撑多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00209",
      "start_ms": 477510,
      "end_ms": 479735,
      "text": "答案就藏在祁连山的雪里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00210",
      "start_ms": 480110,
      "end_ms": 481890,
      "text": "一旦祁连山降雪减少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00211",
      "start_ms": 482030,
      "end_ms": 483550,
      "text": "或者河流改道断流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00212",
      "start_ms": 483710,
      "end_ms": 486015,
      "text": "敦煌就会迅速被沙漠吞没。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00213",
      "start_ms": 486370,
      "end_ms": 488830,
      "text": "历史上曾经繁华一时的楼兰古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00214",
      "start_ms": 489070,
      "end_ms": 490370,
      "text": "正是因为水源消失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00215",
      "start_ms": 490390,
      "end_ms": 492295,
      "text": "一夜之间被风沙掩埋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00216",
      "start_ms": 492580,
      "end_ms": 496095,
      "text": "而敦煌和楼兰的地理结构几乎一模一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00217",
      "start_ms": 496430,
      "end_ms": 497970,
      "text": "同样依赖内陆河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00218",
      "start_ms": 498130,
      "end_ms": 499570,
      "text": "同样守在沙漠边缘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00219",
      "start_ms": 499750,
      "end_ms": 502135,
      "text": "同样没有稳定的外部水源补给，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00220",
      "start_ms": 502400,
      "end_ms": 504815,
      "text": "唯一的区别是敦煌还没有断水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00221",
      "start_ms": 505150,
      "end_ms": 505865,
      "text": "但在今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00222",
      "start_ms": 506120,
      "end_ms": 508240,
      "text": "随着气候变化和人类用水增加，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00223",
      "start_ms": 508400,
      "end_ms": 510895,
      "text": "敦煌的水资源正在变得越来越紧张。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00224",
      "start_ms": 511300,
      "end_ms": 512000,
      "text": "如果有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00225",
      "start_ms": 512180,
      "end_ms": 513605,
      "text": "河流真的撑不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00226",
      "start_ms": 513830,
      "end_ms": 514070,
      "text": "那么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00227",
      "start_ms": 514070,
      "end_ms": 516110,
      "text": "敦煌的命运会不会重演？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00228",
      "start_ms": 516190,
      "end_ms": 518180,
      "text": "楼兰的结局你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00229",
      "start_ms": 518280,
      "end_ms": 520880,
      "text": "敦煌是我见过的最珍视游客的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00230",
      "start_ms": 520960,
      "end_ms": 522600,
      "text": "没有之一市容市吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00231",
      "start_ms": 522600,
      "end_ms": 524400,
      "text": "竟然比很多一线城市还要好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00232",
      "start_ms": 524750,
      "end_ms": 526630,
      "text": "这里没有国内旅游城市的弊病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00233",
      "start_ms": 526770,
      "end_ms": 533975,
      "text": "比如脏乱差的街道、高频次的摆摊、叫卖、旅拍、拉人、出租车、套路、横冲直撞的汽车、电动车等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00234",
      "start_ms": 534320,
      "end_ms": 535720,
      "text": "敦煌打车起步价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00235",
      "start_ms": 535720,
      "end_ms": 536425,
      "text": "只要六块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00236",
      "start_ms": 536710,
      "end_ms": 538070,
      "text": "从鸣沙山到夜市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00237",
      "start_ms": 538210,
      "end_ms": 540450,
      "text": "还有一辆接着一辆的免费接驳车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00238",
      "start_ms": 540770,
      "end_ms": 544170,
      "text": "这里的夜市可没有千篇一律的景区大鱿鱼臭豆腐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00239",
      "start_ms": 544330,
      "end_ms": 546450,
      "text": "全是地地道道的西北风味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00240",
      "start_ms": 546630,
      "end_ms": 547470,
      "text": "价格公道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00241",
      "start_ms": 547550,
      "end_ms": 548910,
      "text": "出品干净稳定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00242",
      "start_ms": 549270,
      "end_ms": 550350,
      "text": "甚至你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00243",
      "start_ms": 550530,
      "end_ms": 552150,
      "text": "夜晚十二点的敦煌店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00244",
      "start_ms": 552150,
      "end_ms": 553290,
      "text": "还有理发店开门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00245",
      "start_ms": 553630,
      "end_ms": 556290,
      "text": "因为晚上很多从沙漠上下来的旅客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00246",
      "start_ms": 556510,
      "end_ms": 557430,
      "text": "一头沙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00247",
      "start_ms": 557490,
      "end_ms": 559170,
      "text": "或者有妆发都比较难洗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00248",
      "start_ms": 559430,
      "end_ms": 560970,
      "text": "一天下来也比较累了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00249",
      "start_ms": 560970,
      "end_ms": 562470,
      "text": "自己洗又很麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00250",
      "start_ms": 562470,
      "end_ms": 564750,
      "text": "所以他们开到晚上一点半左右，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00251",
      "start_ms": 565070,
      "end_ms": 567120,
      "text": "真的是处处为游客着想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00252",
      "start_ms": 567300,
      "end_ms": 569860,
      "text": "吃住行都能给你安排的妥妥当当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00253",
      "start_ms": 570160,
      "end_ms": 571120,
      "text": "而且你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00254",
      "start_ms": 571240,
      "end_ms": 573560,
      "text": "月牙泉景区内竟然还有红绿灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00255",
      "start_ms": 573860,
      "end_ms": 575780,
      "text": "第一次见到沙漠里的红绿灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00256",
      "start_ms": 575980,
      "end_ms": 577340,
      "text": "你是不是会觉得很奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00257",
      "start_ms": 577520,
      "end_ms": 581460,
      "text": "其实这红绿灯专门是给骆驼队修建的分流人和骆驼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00258",
      "start_ms": 581740,
      "end_ms": 582920,
      "text": "绿灯亮的时候呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00259",
      "start_ms": 582920,
      "end_ms": 584200,
      "text": "骆驼就会自己行走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00260",
      "start_ms": 584280,
      "end_ms": 584920,
      "text": "红灯亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00261",
      "start_ms": 584960,
      "end_ms": 587560,
      "text": "骆驼就会停到了旅游旺季的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00262",
      "start_ms": 587580,
      "end_ms": 589895,
      "text": "这里面还会出现堵骆驼的情况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00263",
      "start_ms": 590470,
      "end_ms": 591330,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00264",
      "start_ms": 591330,
      "end_ms": 593430,
      "text": "眼前这些柳树叫左公柳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00265",
      "start_ms": 593670,
      "end_ms": 598230,
      "text": "当年左宗棠下令从陕西到新疆的沿途广种柳树杨树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00266",
      "start_ms": 598550,
      "end_ms": 600850,
      "text": "至今在敦煌鸣沙山月牙泉畔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00267",
      "start_ms": 601070,
      "end_ms": 602610,
      "text": "仍存有他所植树林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00268",
      "start_ms": 602610,
      "end_ms": 605050,
      "text": "超过一百四十年的月泉古柳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00269",
      "start_ms": 605230,
      "end_ms": 606070,
      "text": "而你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00270",
      "start_ms": 606090,
      "end_ms": 610190,
      "text": "在敦煌找不到任何一根还在冒烟的火电厂烟囱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00271",
      "start_ms": 610510,
      "end_ms": 612590,
      "text": "中国人在敦煌造了一个太阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00272",
      "start_ms": 613030,
      "end_ms": 614430,
      "text": "你在深夜熟睡时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00273",
      "start_ms": 614510,
      "end_ms": 617250,
      "text": "中国西北的荒漠正在挂着一颗人造太阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00274",
      "start_ms": 617470,
      "end_ms": 619050,
      "text": "它不是科幻电影的道具，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00275",
      "start_ms": 619190,
      "end_ms": 621940,
      "text": "而是一座真实月进行了超级电站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00276",
      "start_ms": 621940,
      "end_ms": 626320,
      "text": "敦煌已经成了全中国唯一一个百分之百绿电覆盖的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00277",
      "start_ms": 626600,
      "end_ms": 629740,
      "text": "而敦煌自己发的这些电跨越几千公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00278",
      "start_ms": 629800,
      "end_ms": 630700,
      "text": "冲向湖南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00279",
      "start_ms": 630860,
      "end_ms": 632600,
      "text": "点亮上海的摩天大楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00280",
      "start_ms": 632820,
      "end_ms": 636080,
      "text": "成为你手机屏幕上跳动的那个绿色电能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00281",
      "start_ms": 636280,
      "end_ms": 638000,
      "text": "这就是文明的浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00282",
      "start_ms": 638460,
      "end_ms": 641760,
      "text": "如今我们今天花几个小时就能抵达的敦煌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00283",
      "start_ms": 641940,
      "end_ms": 644500,
      "text": "是古人用半生才能抵达的远方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00284",
      "start_ms": 644840,
      "end_ms": 646780,
      "text": "这里有王道士的无声叹息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00285",
      "start_ms": 647020,
      "end_ms": 649775,
      "text": "有常春红樊景师们的终身守护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00286",
      "start_ms": 650140,
      "end_ms": 652185,
      "text": "有春风不度玉门关的苍凉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00287",
      "start_ms": 652410,
      "end_ms": 654785,
      "text": "也有西出阳关无故人的怅然。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00288",
      "start_ms": 655220,
      "end_ms": 657240,
      "text": "霍去病的马蹄声逐渐远去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00289",
      "start_ms": 657500,
      "end_ms": 659835,
      "text": "左宫柳还在月牙泉边摇曳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00290",
      "start_ms": 660190,
      "end_ms": 661235,
      "text": "我们终会老去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00291",
      "start_ms": 661510,
      "end_ms": 663755,
      "text": "但文明不能在我手里老去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00292",
      "start_ms": 664190,
      "end_ms": 668010,
      "text": "祖先们把一千年前的敦煌交给了我们我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9e1d7750c78c69e8_s00293",
      "start_ms": 668010,
      "end_ms": 671405,
      "text": "又将把一个怎样敦煌交给下一个一千年。"
    }
  ],
